WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Heat treatment. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Explain why processing changes properties

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Heat treatment changes material structure through controlled thermal processing. The outcome depends on alloy and process details.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: A process card must name material, temperature/time history and cooling condition before predicting properties.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Process sequence

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Material category alone does not guarantee strength, durability or safety.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Explain why processing changes properties
